# Only reviewed public documents belong in this repository.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/PRIVACY.md
!/LICENSE.md
!/NOTICE.md
!/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md

# The root allowlist above also excludes local assistant files and logs.
# Examples: AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .codex/, .claude/, .cursor/, *.log, *.jsonl.
